{
  "description": "Gate-G1 benchmark processes (tools/loop_benchmark): the required-references specification format of tools/loop_reference/required_processes.json (same 'qcd' scheme, loop_sm-no_b_mass), with the 2->2 control and the 2->3/2->4 QCD processes that the v2 generator of work/v2-slice produces. 'madloop.export' is the MadLoop export built with MG5's production flags, relative to the reference root (--reference-root); 'openloops.unavailable' records why a process has no OpenLoops library.",
  "schemes": {
    "qcd": {
      "description": "QCD corrections in the MG5 loop_sm-no_b_mass model: alpha=1/aEWM1 fixed with Gf and MZ (MW derived at tree level), stable top, massless b/tau/light fermions, all widths zero, five-flavour alpha_s renormalization with decoupled top, six quark flavours in loops, Feynman gauge.",
